  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 974863,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 100% NL: A Commodore 64 Wordplay Challenge\n\nStep into the fast-paced world of 100% NL, a clever adaptation of the classic TV game show, *The $100,000 Pyramid*, for the Commodore 64!  Compete against a friend or test your wits in single-player mode as you race to the top of the pyramid. \n\nEach round presents a category – from \"animals\" to \"vehicles\" – filled with words linked by a common theme. The challenge? One player provides clues, cleverly avoiding the actual words, while the other frantically tries to guess them.  Time is ticking!  Quick thinking and sharp observation are key to success.\n\nThe single-player mode offers a different kind of puzzle, requiring you to craft concise, one-word clues to guide a computer opponent.  Experience the thrill of rapid-fire word association and strategic clue-giving in this engaging and addictive game.  Can you conquer the pyramid and reach the ultimate prize?  100% NL is a must-have for word game enthusiasts!"
    },
